[{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0736","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0736.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0939","title":"Debian Linux IRC客户端epic/epic4长字符串拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Debian Linux 2.1/2.2 系统中自带的 IRC 客户端 epic 及 epic4 存在输入验证缺陷，当向客户端发送超长字符串时，会触发缓冲区溢出导致客户端崩溃，造成拒绝服务。攻击者可通过 IRC 协议远程发送特制长字符串触发该漏洞，无需身份认证，攻击复杂度低。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0939"],"sources":["cve","epss"],"published":"1999-08-26T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级到已修复该漏洞的 epic/epic4 版本，或使用其他更安全的 IRC 客户端替代。Debian 官方在后续版本中已修复此输入长度校验缺陷。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-19T03:14:01Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/605"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0736.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1018","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1018.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1235","title":"Microsoft Internet Explorer 5 FTP 密码信息泄露漏洞","description":"Microsoft Internet Explorer 5.0 在访问 FTP 服务器时会自动将用户名和密码记录在 URL 历史中，导致凭据信息以明文形式存储在本地 index.dat 文件中。本地攻击者可读取其他用户的浏览历史获取 FTP 凭据，或通过肩窥（shoulder surfing）方式在用户鼠标悬停链接时从状态栏窃取密码。该漏洞影响 IE 5 版本，属于信息泄露问题，CVSS 评分 4.6。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1235"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-08-25T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:00Z","remediation":"升级到 Internet Explorer 6 或更高版本，IE5 已停止支持且不再接收安全更新。如无法升级浏览器，建议清除 IE 历史记录中的 FTP 密码（工具→Internet 选项→清除历史记录），并避免在公共场合使用 IE 访问 FTP 站点。长期缓解措施为迁移至现代浏览器（如 Edge/Chrome/Firefox）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://ntbugtraq.ntadvice.com/default.asp?pid=36&sid=1&A2=ind9904&L=NTBUGTRAQ&P=R179","http://packetderm.cotse.com/mailing-lists/ntbugtraq/1999/0364.html","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/3289","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19473","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/50269681ee58c9b5bf7169b73546eef94697389c/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1235.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1235","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1235.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4631642e37ce9ee8b9057e387df4aee61487fb70/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1235.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/f37077e857e7a28bab83d284c23299407fb1af7e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-v7w3-r9q2-mwx4/GHSA-v7w3-r9q2-mwx4.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x88000/87772/info.html","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153600_153700.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/39f1db26eec9899ab2f8110ab3b45424c6fe9ec2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1235.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000751.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--fe06dc37-1641-4571-a309-13ef3dac15ec.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1018.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0669","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0669.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0872","title":"Caldera OpenLinux Vixie cron 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Vixie cron 组件在处理 crontab 文件中的 MAILTO 环境变量时存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。本地攻击者可利用该漏洞，通过向 crontab 文件中写入超长的 MAILTO 变量值触发缓冲区溢出，从而获取 root 权限。该漏洞影响 Caldera OpenLinux 等系统，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。建议用户升级至最新版本或限制 crontab 文件的写入权限。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0872"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-08-25T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:13Z","remediation":"升级到 OpenLinux 更新版本的 vixie-cron 包（修复版本见厂商 1999 年安全公告并打全系统补丁）。临时缓解措施：将 crontab 文件及 cron 服务目录权限收紧为仅 root 可写（chmod 600 /etc/crontab 且 chmod 700 /var/spool/cron），并限制普通用户使用 crontab 命令（移除 /usr/bin/crontab 的 setuid 位或仅授权信任用户），避免通过过长 MAILTO 环境变量触发缓冲区溢出提权。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-17T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/611","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/759","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4d7236390d3d65194e590e3c8620543620af3984/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0872.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0872","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/e046e4965f64348bd29a0c62edd023b3c580939e/content/CVE-1999-0872.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6d3a932c05085f06507d23e5a0893fa8fe64ce42/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0872.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1ef90eac7bb1a353721fe038daf41872bdff01c4/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-9rpr-p9f6-2hhx/GHSA-9rpr-p9f6-2hhx.json","https://github.com/feng-li/tools-for-data-science-course/blob/8e62d47ee8ffbebe9a0e50aee193617f83883118/2019spring/2017312271/result.txt","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x1000/759/info.html","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153600_153700.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--20b2865f-6121-40d9-88ae-cc16ce538ecd.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000750.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0669.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0489","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0489.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0769","title":"Linux Vixie Cron 计划任务 MAILTO 环境变量注入漏洞","description":"Vixie Cron 是 Linux 系统中广泛使用的定时任务守护进程。该漏洞源于 Vixie Cron 在处理 MAILTO 环境变量时未对输入参数进行充分验证，本地用户可通过构造特制的 MAILTO 环境变量值，向系统 sendmail 命令注入恶意参数，进而执行任意命令。该漏洞影响 Caldera OpenLinux 2.2、Debian 2.1/2.2 以及 RedHat 6.0 等早期 Linux 发行版，CVSS 评分 7.2。攻击者需具备本地登录权限，通过在 crontab 配置或环境变量中设置恶意 MAILTO 值即可触发，导致权限提升或系统被进一步控制。建议用户升级至修正后的 Vixie Cron 版本，或通过限制本地用户环境变量写入权限来缓解风险。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0769"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-08-25T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:01Z","remediation":"建议升级 Vixie Cron 至各发行版已修复版本：Debian 用户升级至 cron 3.0pl1-57 及以上，RedHat 用户安装 vixie-cron 更新包，Caldera 用户应用对应的安全补丁。升级后 MAILTO 环境变量将不再被用于拼接 sendmail 命令参数。如无法立即升级，可临时限制普通用户对 crontab 的使用权限（通过 /etc/cron.allow 和 /etc/cron.deny 控制），并加强对 crontab 提交内容的审计。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-18T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/611","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19474","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e244b55bdff85b2483c0e6a7cecd12f8bee0df6e/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0769.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0769","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/5cf8ba64f356efe9269b21eca2f657231acd746c/content/CVE-1999-0769.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/70f84d5684ed60f7a4d0750993d15c30e4fe3bbf/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0769.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/958f1672375e115879b3a6bd13e3638812260c7d/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-9qf9-2h54-chr8/GHSA-9qf9-2h54-chr8.json","https://github.com/feng-li/tools-for-data-science-course/blob/8e62d47ee8ffbebe9a0e50aee193617f83883118/2019spring/2017312271/result.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153600_153700.json","https://github.com/debiancn/debian.org/blob/6abc98daa6356b20e410013a6920b3764af682d4/english/security/1999/19990830.data","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0769.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--96d6bfc3-3242-4258-a570-581568f1a763.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/1999/POC-AVE-1999-0489.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/1999/EXP-AVE-1999-0489.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0489.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0483","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0483.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0768","title":"{\"_meta\":{},\"stopReason\":\"end_turn\",\"usage\":{\"cachedReadTokens\":1664,\"inputTokens\":9208,\"outputTokens\":29,\"totalTokens\":10901}}","description":"Vixie Cron 在 Red Hat Linux 及 S.u.S.E. Linux 系统上存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，攻击者可通过特制的 MAILTO 环境变量值触发该漏洞。该漏洞影响 Red Hat Linux 4.2/5.2/6.0 以及 S.u.S.E. Linux 6.0/6.1 等版本。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可在 cron 任务中设置超长的 MAILTO 环境变量值，当系统尝试向该地址发送邮件通知时，cron 进程将触发缓冲区溢出，攻击者可能借此获得 root 权限执行任意代码。CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0768"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-08-25T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:01Z","remediation":"升级到已修复该漏洞的 Red Hat Linux 6.1 及以上版本或 S.u.S.E. Linux 6.2 及以上版本，并安装厂商发布的 Vixie Cron 安全补丁（如 Red Hat RPM 更新包）。如无法立即升级，可临时删除或限制 crontab 中 MAILTO 环境变量的使用，并将 /usr/bin/crontab 权限收紧为仅 root 可写，以降低被本地用户利用缓冲区溢出提权的风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-18T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/602","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19470","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e244b55bdff85b2483c0e6a7cecd12f8bee0df6e/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0768.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0768","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/5cf8ba64f356efe9269b21eca2f657231acd746c/content/CVE-1999-0768.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/70f84d5684ed60f7a4d0750993d15c30e4fe3bbf/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0768.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/958f1672375e115879b3a6bd13e3638812260c7d/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-q395-vm9c-r75g/GHSA-q395-vm9c-r75g.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0768.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153600_153700.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_0.list.dict","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0483.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0905","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0905.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1052","title":"{\"_meta\":{},\"stopReason\":\"end_turn\",\"usage\":{\"inputTokens\":10796,\"outputTokens\":20,\"totalTokens\":10816}}","description":"Microsoft FrontPage 在默认配置下会将网站表单提交的结果保存于文档根目录下的 /_private/form_results.txt 文件中，该文件具有全局可读权限且可直接通过 HTTP 访问。由于该路径为默认位置且未进行访问控制，远程攻击者无需身份认证，只需向目标站点发起普通的 HTTP GET 请求即可读取此文件内容，从而获取其他用户通过表单提交的敏感信息，如姓名、邮箱、电话、留言等个人数据。该漏洞影响使用默认配置且未修改该文件权限或移除该文件的 Microsoft FrontPage 网站，属于信息泄露类配置缺陷。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1052"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-08-24T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:36Z","remediation":"升级到 Microsoft FrontPage 2000 或更高版本，并在 Web 服务器中删除站点根目录下 /_private/form_results.txt 文件。将表单结果保存路径移出 Web 文档根目录，或在 Web 服务器配置中拒绝对该目录的匿名访问（如用 .htaccess 或 IIS 目录权限设置为不可列出、不可读取），对表单提交内容做访问控制与加密存储以缓解信息泄露。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-19T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=93582550911564&w=2","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b4f1378756fd26f414d09a97dc81126672830951/1999/CVE-1999-1052.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/dde4d96d7c1eff197b9a15817af615500736afa7/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1052.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1052","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d7bfe9c86213fdf5ad56116fa46ee20a047ec9da/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1052.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/1999/CVE-1999-1052.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/ce77465efdf58fc31a7a0bc8c83705be48abcedf/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-8552-5cm2-7wch/GHSA-8552-5cm2-7wch.json","https://github.com/feng-li/tools-for-data-science-course/blob/8e62d47ee8ffbebe9a0e50aee193617f83883118/2019spring/2017312271/result.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-1052.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x89000/88081/info.html","https://github.com/magicsword-io/Magic-SigExplorer/blob/2c28b91b003429a144a687199ee99ebd26f1a343/Magic-SigExplorer/docs/cve_report.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/1999/POC-AVE-1999-0905.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/1999/EXP-AVE-1999-0905.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0905.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0320","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0320.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0720","title":"glibc pt_chown 权限提升漏洞","description":"glibc 2.1.1 及之前版本中的 pt_chown 辅助程序被安装为 setuid root，本地普通用户可利用该程序在伪终端（PTY）设备上修改属主与权限，从而获取其他用户的控制终端访问权限，实现本地权限提升。攻击者需具备本地登录权限，通过精心构造的请求使 pt_chown 错误地将 TTY 设备归属到攻击者的 UID，进而读取或注入其他用户的终端会话内容。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0720"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-08-23T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T00:00:00Z","remediation":"将系统 glibc 升级至 2.1.2 或更高版本，该版本已移除 pt_chown 的 setuid 权限，消除本地用户借由 pt_chown 篡改其他用户 TTY 设备进而提权的风险。如短期内无法升级，应立即执行 chmod u-s /usr/lib/pt_chown 去掉 setuid 位，或在确认无依赖后删除该二进制文件作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-17T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/597","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=lcamtuf.4.05.9907041223290.355-300000%40nimue.ids.pl","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19467","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/64d76d92cfbd9c4de4a352a59a2e52cadebc3afd/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0720.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/1999/POC-AVE-1999-0320.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/1999/EXP-AVE-1999-0320.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0320.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1689","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1689.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1064","title":"WindowMaker 缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"WindowMaker 桌面环境 0.52 至 0.60.0 版本中存在多处缓冲区溢出漏洞。攻击者通过执行 WindowMaker 时传入超长的程序名称（argv[0]）参数，可触发缓冲区溢出，导致拒绝服务甚至可能执行任意代码。该漏洞影响面较广，利用方式简单，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1064"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-08-22T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:37Z","remediation":"升级 Window Maker 至 0.61.0 及以上版本（当前最新稳定版为 0.96.0），该版本修复了 wdefaults.c 中 strcpy 未做边界检查导致的缓冲区溢出问题。可通过系统包管理器（apt install wmaker / dnf install wmaker）直接更新。如无法升级，可在启动脚本中限制 argv[0] 长度不超过 249 字符作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=93555317429630&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=93582070508957&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/596"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1689.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1108","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1108.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0878","title":"WU-FTPD MAPPING_CHDIR 远程缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"WU-FTPD 及相关 FTP 服务器在处理 MAPPING_CHDIR 命令时存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可向目标 FTP 服务器发送特制的超长 MAPPING_CHDIR 命令，触发缓冲区溢出，覆盖内存中的关键数据结构，从而以 root 权限执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 WU-FTPD 及其衍生 FTP 服务器软件，攻击者只需能够连接到目标 FTP 服务的 21 端口即可利用，利用难度低，可完全控制受影响系统。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0878"],"sources":["cve","avd"],"published":"1999-08-22T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T00:00:00Z","remediation":"WU-FTPD 已停止维护多年，官方未发布安全补丁。建议立即停止使用 WU-FTPD，迁移至受支持且无此漏洞的替代 FTP 服务器软件，如 vsftpd 3.0.x、ProFTPD 1.3.x 或 Pure-FTPD 最新稳定版。如无法立即迁移，应在防火墙层面限制对 FTP 服务的访问来源 IP，仅允许可信网络段访问，并禁用不必要的 FTP 功能。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-19T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/599","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-1999-0878"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1108.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0184","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0184.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0668","title":"Microsoft Internet Explorer 5 ActiveX 安全标记错误远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Microsoft Internet Explorer 5 中的 scriptlet.typelib ActiveX 控件被错误地标记为\"安全用于脚本\", 导致远程攻击者可通过诱导用户访问恶意网页, 利用该 ActiveX 控件执行任意命令(如 Bubbleboy 漏洞演示的文件写入攻击)。该漏洞影响 Microsoft Internet Explorer 5 版本, 攻击条件为用户访问恶意网页并启用 ActiveX, 攻击者可借此在用户系统上执行任意代码或写入文件, CVSS 评分 5.1, 属中危漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.1,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0668"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-08-21T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:48Z","remediation":"建议立即升级至 Internet Explorer 5.01 SP1 或更高版本，或安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS99-032 补丁（KB240308）；无法升级时可在 IE“Internet 区域”安全设置中将“运行未标记为安全的 ActiveX 控件”设为“禁用”，或为 scriptlet.typelib (CLSID: 06290BD5-48AA-11D2-8432-006008C3FBFC) 设置 Kill Bit 禁用该 ActiveX 控件","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-17T00:00:00Z","references":["http://ciac.llnl.gov/ciac/bulletins/j-064.shtml","http://support.microsoft.com/default.aspx?scid=kb%3B%5BLN%5D%3BQ240308","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/598","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/1999/ms99-032","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19468","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8d0ba8eaeba3ff3558e6044a19d5b454dcc12f33/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0668.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0668","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/e046e4965f64348bd29a0c62edd023b3c580939e/content/CVE-1999-0668.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/512c773c61886081b2589de76a8cfde795349819/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0668.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/3c5965e4a3ad0d0b437f880f71224c9e3d8d5fd5/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-mf4v-53v8-r6cm/GHSA-mf4v-53v8-r6cm.json","https://github.com/feng-li/tools-for-data-science-course/blob/8e62d47ee8ffbebe9a0e50aee193617f83883118/2019spring/2017312271/result.txt","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153500_153600.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/178b809924783e13787d17bb1b1fd55ad3b8639b/nvdcve/CVE-1999-0668.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--1311b123-7ec1-4ac2-beca-9860a9f96c2e.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/1999/POC-AVE-1999-0184.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/1999/EXP-AVE-1999-0184.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0184.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0668","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0668.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0668","title":"Microsoft Internet Explorer scriptlet.typelib ActiveX 控件远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Internet Explorer 中的 scriptlet.typelib ActiveX 控件被错误标记为「可安全执行脚本」，远程攻击者可通过构造恶意网页利用该漏洞执行任意命令。Bubbleboy 蠕虫即利用此漏洞进行传播，影响 Microsoft Internet Explorer 4.0 和 5.0 版本，用户访问恶意网页即可能触发漏洞，导致系统被完全控制。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.1,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0668"],"sources":["cve","epss"],"published":"1999-08-21T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T00:00:00Z","remediation":"安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS99-032 提供的安全更新补丁，或升级 Internet Explorer 至更高版本以修复 ActiveX 控件的安全脚本标记问题。对于无法升级的系统，在 Internet 安全区域中将'对标记为可安全执行脚本的 ActiveX 控件执行脚本'设置为禁用。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://ciac.llnl.gov/ciac/bulletins/j-064.shtml","http://support.microsoft.com/default.aspx?scid=kb;%5BLN%5D;Q240308","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/598","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/1999/ms99-032"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0668.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1188","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1188.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1565","title":"man2html 任意文件写入漏洞","description":"man2html 在处理 CGI 临时文件时未对文件名进行安全校验，存在符号链接（symlink）竞争条件漏洞。本地攻击者通过在程序创建临时文件之前建立符号链接指向目标系统文件，可导致 man2html 将输出内容写入攻击者指定的任意文件，从而覆盖或篡改敏感数据。该漏洞影响 man2html 2.1 及之前版本，利用前提是攻击者拥有本地系统访问权限。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1565"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-08-20T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:43Z","remediation":"升级 man2html 至 2.2 及以上版本，该版本已修复临时文件创建时的竞态条件与符号链接攻击问题。如无法升级，建议使用 `mktemp` 命令创建临时文件而非在 `/tmp` 下使用可预测文件名，或改用 `man2html` 的替代方案（如 `groff` + `man` 直接生成 HTML）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.osvdb.org/6291","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/24784","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4f761f58350f835cb02025d033f6f8c7f536e6b7/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1565.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1565","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-1999-1565.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f73aeebc806b7ab5e9488498a056b9fa7bf30dd7/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1565.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/26d7afd7aa97d50454756aec5636fa553464ffd2/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-xq33-vcxx-f474/GHSA-xq33-vcxx-f474.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x88000/87953/info.html","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1565.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153600_153700.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000739.txt","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1188.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1184","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1184.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1561","title":"Nullsoft SHOUTcast 服务器管理密码明文存储漏洞","description":"Nullsoft SHOUTcast 服务器在配置文件 sc_serv.conf 中以明文存储管理员密码，导致具有本地访问权限的攻击者可读取该配置文件获取管理员凭据，进而获得服务器管理权限。该漏洞影响 SHOUTcast 服务器，利用条件为攻击者需具备本地系统访问权限，可进一步控制服务器运行环境。CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1561"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-08-20T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:43Z","remediation":"将 SHOUTcast 配置文件 sc_serv.conf 的权限设为仅服务器运行用户可读（chmod 600），并使用独立的低权限专用账户运行 SHOUTcast 服务，避免与管理员共用同一系统账户。若仍使用 SHOUTcast 1.x 旧版，建议升级至 SHOUTcast 2.6 或迁移至 Icecast 等持续维护的替代方案，消除明文密码存储问题。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/24852","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e37edb84f090321c2ab4b4aefc57f84a75b1b940/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1561.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1561","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-1999-1561.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f73aeebc806b7ab5e9488498a056b9fa7bf30dd7/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1561.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/26d7afd7aa97d50454756aec5636fa553464ffd2/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-3p7f-hw68-ph5v/GHSA-3p7f-hw68-ph5v.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x88000/87926/info.html","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1561.json","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/75b00841a2a9a706d877d383325aa431229b4a9b/1999.tsv","https://github.com/Yuning-J/NVDFeatureAnalysis/blob/493a57a415cc110f9945148abd717eeb92f6ca7e/originalDataset/cveIDThreatType/cve_idgainpre"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1184.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0364","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0364.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0743","title":"Trn 本地用户符号链接覆盖其他用户文件漏洞","description":"Trn 新闻阅读器存在本地符号链接漏洞，本地用户可通过创建符号链接指向其他用户文件，在特定条件下覆盖目标文件内容。该漏洞源于程序在处理临时文件时未对符号链接进行充分校验，攻击者需要拥有本地系统访问权限，利用难度较低但影响范围有限（仅影响同系统用户），CVSS 评分 2.1 危害等级低。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0743"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-08-20T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:57Z","remediation":"升级 Trn 至修复了不安全临时文件创建的版本（trn 4.0-test77 之后版本），或在 Linux 内核中通过 fs.protected_symlinks=1 启用符号链接保护（sysctl -w fs.protected_symlinks=1）。如无法升级，建议将 /tmp 挂载为 noexec,nosuid 并使用 private /tmp 模式（systemd 默认启用），同时在 cron 中定期清理 /tmp 下的 Trn 临时文件。使用 tmpfiles.d 或 pam_namespace 对每位用户隔离临时目录可彻底阻断此类攻击。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-16T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/3144","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4e6f80460dd56d97b6079eb72c9467b9a961ce1b/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0743.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0743","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/45be3b4afd9c4397ee32a5cbf6819a590220b0c1/content/CVE-1999-0743.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/a75ebb477762f54f32c38d85ec939339ec2712e5/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0743.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e434c1da6464de3012c6c1eff8c0e19ef9669023/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-w5gh-xpm5-prq2/GHSA-w5gh-xpm5-prq2.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0743.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x89000/88064/info.html","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153500_153600.json","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--f7f02ce6-65e9-4ce7-aacb-b8528cfb6e7e.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0364.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0555","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0555.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0741","title":"QMS CrownNet Unix 认证绕过漏洞","description":"QMS CrownNet Unix Utilities for 2060 存在严重身份认证绕过漏洞，系统默认允许 root 用户无需密码即可直接登录，攻击者可通过 telnet 或 rlogin 等远程访问服务利用该漏洞获取目标系统的超级用户权限。该漏洞影响 QMS CrownNet 2060 系列设备，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重，攻击复杂度低且无需认证，可导致设备完全受控。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0741"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-08-19T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:57Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 QMS CrownNet Unix Utilities 至修复版本（需联系 QMS 获取补丁），或在 /etc/securetty 中禁止 root 远程登录，同时配置 PAM 认证强制要求密码验证。若设备已停止维护，请部署网络隔离并限制 515 端口仅允许受信 IP 访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-18T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/593","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f54846af4ec1affce3d519a6791531e8f1f5b8fe/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0741.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0741","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/939392c6c114126badd68bf811168babfcf07fe3/1999/CVE-1999-0741/README.md","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/e046e4965f64348bd29a0c62edd023b3c580939e/content/CVE-1999-0741.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/cf6074d8ac2128dee0a2ac26c5f652ae6527df79/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0741.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/8b1565557a8e0fb04634f0989d7e7dd7febd4847/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-hmmr-pvfg-gcfv/GHSA-hmmr-pvfg-gcfv.json","https://github.com/feng-li/tools-for-data-science-course/blob/8e62d47ee8ffbebe9a0e50aee193617f83883118/2019spring/2017312271/result.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/178b809924783e13787d17bb1b1fd55a